            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O Skin Deep é um imersivo jogo de tiros em primeira pessoa. Temos espirros. Temos coisas a ficarem presas nos pés. Avança por esta vasta nave estelar não linear e infiltra-te, subverte e sabota para sobreviveres nesta caixa de areia estelar. Estás em menor número, com menos armas e sem sapatos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>UMA APÓLICE DE SEGURO COM PERNAS E QUE FALA<br>Quando as empresas de seguros querem manter os seus valores a salvo, congelam-te e colocam-te nas suas naves de carga.<br><br>E quando os piratas espaciais abordam a nave e acionam o alarme silencioso, tu descongelas, respiras fundo e resolves a situação.<br><br>Boa sorte, operativo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/d6247e389ab22ab280293d758d8daefb.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O Skin Deep é um imersivo jogo de tiros em primeira pessoa. Temos espirros. Temos coisas a ficarem presas nos pés. Avança por esta vasta nave estelar não linear e infiltra-te, subverte e sabota para sobreviveres nesta caixa de areia estelar. Estás em menor número, com menos armas e sem sapatos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/be6f04d840c88a451065c3ead95fc5f6.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>UMA APÓLICE DE SEGURO COM PERNAS E QUE FALA<br>Quando as empresas de seguros querem manter os seus valores a salvo, congelam-te e colocam-te nas suas naves de carga.<br><br>E quando os piratas espaciais abordam a nave e acionam o alarme silencioso, tu descongelas, respiras fundo e resolves a situação.<br><br>Boa sorte, operativo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.poster.avif?t=1774979656\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.webm?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/301280/extras/12f48196a80b685deb98654dee345420.mp4?t=1774979656\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "short_description": "Skin Deep é um imersivo jogo de tiros em primeira pessoa. Temos espirros e coisas a ficar presas nos pés. Avança por esta nave estelar não linear e infiltra-te, subverte e sabota para sobreviver nesta caixa de areia estelar. Estás em minoria, com menos armas e sem sapatos! Bem-vindo ao Skin Deep!",
